'Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.normalized_fourier_right' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.normalized_fourier_right (i j : Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.Index) :
  Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.kMatMul Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.exactFourier
