'Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.interpret_conj' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.interpret_conj (x : Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.Cyclo12) :
  Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.interpret (Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.cConj x) =
