'Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.interpret_pow' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.interpret_pow (x : Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.Cyclo12) (n : ℕ) :
  Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.interpret (Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.cPow x n) =
