'Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.complexMatrix_mul' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.complexMatrix_mul (A B : Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.KMatrix) :
  Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.complexMatrix (Komorebi.QuantumArithmetic.kMatMul A B) =
